  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen Financial Market Infrastructure and Inclusion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&apos;s Development Objective is to develop a payment infrastructure that supports the efficiency of payment transactions in Yemen and increases financial inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the enhancement of the payments infrastructure in Yemen and will include 4 components focused on developing the payments infrastructure and supporting the digitization of payments in Yemen:&#x2022;	Component 1: Development of Fast Payment Systems (FPS) &#x2022;	Component 2: Development of a Real Time Gross Settlement System (RTGS) for Yemen and upgrading of the Core Banking System for CBY-Aden &#x2022;	Component 3: Supporting access and usage of the payment&apos;s infrastructure&#x2022;	Component 4: Project Management</narrative>
  </description>
